WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.720
Someone once said...

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:56.660
There are coffee beans 
that spill out en masse,

00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:00.500
just like in pachinko, when the player 
gets "fever", the biggest jackpot...

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:04.770
Coffever!

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:11.910
Similar to Old Maid, if you eat 
two fruit with the same pattern,

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:15.380
it'll have the finest sweetness,

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:20.650
but the last fruit, the Old Maid,

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:24.790
is an extremely spicy papaya...

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:31.060
Papayold Maid!

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:34.660
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:39.900
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:45.470
While in search of a training 
ingredient, Meteor Garlic,

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:47.540
Toriko and friends became involved 
in a game of Gourmet Tasting.

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:51.180
It's a tough match, but Toriko's team 
successfully came up from behind.

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:55.680
However, they were in a pinch when 
Livebearer consumed an Electric Banana.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:00.790
Finally, only one ingredient 
remains, the deadly Poison Potato!

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:02.860
And it's Livebearer's turn!

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:10.930
There isn't a single ingredient here 
at the Gourmet Casino that I can't eat.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:13.400
You know how to eat it, right?

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.730
Then hurry up and eat it.

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:17.100
The final ingredient...

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:20.540
However... it'll be the 
last one you ever eat.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:27.580
The Moment of Truth! Coco's Daring Scenario!

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:39.460
D-Don't tell me... this was his 
aim from the very beginning?!

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:45.760
The worst eating combination 
for Poison Potato...

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.570
Eating combination?!

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:52.000
When eating things together, there 
are good and bad combinations.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.970
For example...

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:58.110
If you have watermelon and beer together, 
the diuretic effect is so pronounced

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.310
that it's not good for your body.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:05.280
If you eat liver and garlic chives 
together, the allysine in the chives

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:08.020
absorbs the vitamin B from the liver,

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:10.220
which is very good for 
recovering from fatigue.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:14.390
Potatoes contain a substance called solanin.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.660
It's a poisonous ingredient 
found in the buds,

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:21.630
but the deadly poison in Poison Potatoes 
is a new kind, called Neo-solanin.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:25.070
It's approximately 40,000 
times more toxic than solanin.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:29.810
And it's impossible to 
completely remove Neo-solanin.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:34.810
The only way to cook it is to weaken 
the poison as much as possible.

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:37.880
You certainly know a lot about poison...

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:38.910
However...

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.380
...even the weakened poison can 
regain its powerful toxicity

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.820
depending on one's eating combination.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:50.060
Was this information not included 
in the high-priced data you bought?

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.660
No, I recall it was in there...

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.360
Antigens in shellfish...

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.100
...strong alcohol...

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.970
...and the toxin contained 
in Electric Bananas...

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:10.040
Combined, they react with weakened poison, 
causing a strong chemical reaction.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:15.380
When? When did you come up with this order?

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:18.190
After you ate the Golden Shrimp.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:21.390
Then I saw the Poison Potato

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:22.260
and it hit me.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.260
But after I ate the Golden Shrimp,

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:30.330
there was no guarantee I'd eat the Summer 
Whiskey and Electric Banana, right?!

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.600
As for the Summer Whiskey,

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:35.170
our side had already consumed it.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:39.210
I purposely sent that to you 
to give your pride a poke.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:43.010
You see, shallow people 
have the deepest pride.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.310
I knew you would drink it.

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:50.720
But after that, there was still the 
possibility that I'd fight the Hanya Panda!

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:54.290
Out of the 12 ingredients 
that you had obtained,

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:55.920
the only Beast with a high Capture Level...

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.860
...was the Rockadillo.

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:04.100
It was obvious that battling strong 
Beasts was a hassle to you.

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:06.030
I figured you would pass on the Hanya Panda.

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:09.900
I just don't buy it.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.400
Never mind my eating combo,

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:15.310
you wouldn't have willingly put Toriko 
at risk with those lethal ingredients!

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:16.040
Just a little more...

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.840
Just a little more!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.780
I told you before, Livebearer.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:23.450
To me, there are no unlucky ingredients!

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.320
Remember?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.250
The Nitro Cherries were a gamble for us.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:31.420
Toriko had a tough eating combination there.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:34.130
Toriko's eating combination 
was part of the plan, too?!

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.160
Before challenging him 
with the Nitro Cherries,

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:40.230
I made sure Toriko's damage from 
the Hanya Panda was healed,

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.100
because that activated his Gourmet Cells.

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:44.640
I made fresh spring rolls 
from the Hanya Panda

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:49.710
so it wouldn't lose its high 
nutritional content like vitamin B1.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:53.980
By taking in the B1, along 
with the allysine contained

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:55.380
in the Garlic Crab he ate,

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.680
his body was revitalized.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.450
Of course, I also cooked it to be delicious.

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:04.490
The meat of the Dragonfire, which he 
ate just before the Nitro Cherries,

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:07.120
works to counteract detonating ingredients.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:11.430
And the intense odor of the Troll Cheese...

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:14.900
That protected his nose from the 
poisonous vapors of the explosion.

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:20.700
I wondered why you purposely had 
him eat something so stinky!

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:23.940
The vital thing about the Nitro Cherries 
wasn't removing their explosiveness.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:27.140
The priority was drawing out 
their flavor to the max.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:29.880
That's the only way we can win.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:32.020
D-Do you think I can do it?

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:35.490
It'll be fine. I have faith in you, Komatsu.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:37.850
I prepared them, having faith

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:41.920
that Toriko-san's Gourmet Cells would 
hold out with that flavor to go on.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.830
The Shock Lemon after that, too,

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:47.060
its purpose was to restore him with 
its strong cardiotonic action.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:50.900
So three ingredients in a row were to 
help me recover from that last Beast?

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:51.730
That's right.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.540
You should've told me before!

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.600
These guys are somethin' else...

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.600
Sorry.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:57.970
No normal person could've come up with this.

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:59.710
And to eat Nitro Cherries?!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.140
Well?

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.850
Draw the cards, Livebearer.

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:09.380
Whether you weaken the potato's poison 
or try to prepare it some other way,

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.420
you'll still die.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:23.930
All right. I'll eat the Poison Potato.

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:30.640
Fool.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:34.840
Politely explaining your stupid 
strategy at great length...

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:38.680
I'm completely prepared.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:42.980
I shut off my sense of pain. Now 
I won't be able to feel any.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:48.690
Plus, the inner walls of my digestive 
organs, from the esophagus to the rectum,

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.630
are coated with biodegradable plastic!

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:58.430
Now the poison won't be 
absorbed into my body!

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.940
What's all this about eating combos again?!

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:10.510
I'm the king of the Underworld!

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:12.410
In the end, even this game

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:17.320
is nothing but a farce that takes 
place in the palm of my hand!

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.020
I'll eat it all right...

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:25.160
The Poison Potato!!!

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:40.270
I'll eat the Poison Potato all right...

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:43.610
I forgot to mention one thing.

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:46.780
When you drank the Summer Whiskey,

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:48.410
you had it with a snack, right?

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:52.650
The one vegetable that goes 
with Summer Whiskey...

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:54.520
Cheese Cabbage...

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:59.990
A large amount of microbes 
that settle inside it

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.490
breaks down strong alcohol.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.160
And so what if it does?

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.700
Biodegradable plastic...

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.270
Something like that

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:13.770
would easily be broken down by the 
microbes in the Cheese Cabbage.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.250
I told you once.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.790
You had a bad eating combination.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:31.660
H-How...

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:35.460
How did you know my organs were coated?

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:36.690
First of all,

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:39.230
your diet is unbalanced from eating 
ingredients directly from the brain as data.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:43.230
You don't have any interest in 
actual tastes or nutrition, right?

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.440
I assumed you put a membrane 
over your digestive track

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:47.170
as a countermeasure against 
dangerous ingredients,

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:50.110
and block off the taste 
and components as well.

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:53.410
So even me eating Cheese 
Cabbage as a snack...

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.750
You're saying you expected that?

00:10:56.250 --> 00:11:00.220
I didn't know Komatsu-kun was 
going to use that as a snack.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:00.720
But...

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:05.390
...your ogling of Komatsu-kun 
was plain as day.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:09.090
I thought you would take it as a 
good hint for a snack and mimic it.

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:13.460
Now, the time for talking is over.

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:14.400
Are you going to eat it?

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:16.330
Or not?

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:22.500
Th-This can't be...

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.710
...happening to me...

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:27.540
P-Pass!

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.240
Pass, he said!

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:29.480
Livebearer-sama!

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.810
Pass! Pass!

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:35.180
A-As Livebearer-sama gives up,

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:37.150
the turn goes to the other side!

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:39.490
I pass, too!

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:44.160
T-The Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team passes, too!

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.990
The turn goes back again!

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:48.360
Who would've thought this was possible...?

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:52.930
If he passes twice in a row, 
h-he's out of the game!

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.670
You gave up once.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.110
All you can do now is eat it.

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:02.340
These bastards...

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:07.380
These bastards!

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.720
I won't accept it...

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:19.190
I won't accept this.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:21.230
I can't lose...

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:23.430
It's out of the question!

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.300
If you don't eat it,

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.370
that'll be your second "give up".

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:29.200
Livebearer...

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:31.800
You lose.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:45.750
Fine! Enough!

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:48.750
I don't care about the game!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:50.690
Everyone!

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:08.110
I don't care if I lost or not.

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:10.580
Either way, you people

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:14.750
can't escape!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.650
Naturally, I expected this as well.

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:20.490
That's why I said we were done talking.

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:23.420
Men!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.520
Yes, Match-san!

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:29.130
I wanted to use force right from the start.

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:31.100
Leave his henchmen to me and mine.

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:31.660
In exchange...

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.600
...you guys take care of this blockhead.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.880
So you finally show your true colors...

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:58.860
Toriko!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.720
Back up Match and his men.

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:07.900
I'll deal with him. My body's cramping 
up from sitting all that time.

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:54.780
Don't worry. I hit you with 
the back of the sword.

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.710
Fork! Fork! Fork!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.770
Poison Armor!

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:01.540
The hell with your Poison Armor!

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:06.350
Don't make me laugh!

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:34.810
Thank you for your patience!

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:38.840
The last ingredient of Gourmet Tasting!

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:40.380
Poison Potato!

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:42.980
Toriko...

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.720
The last three ingredients you ate...

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.690
They were to prepare you for 
eating the Poison Potato.

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:52.860
The Rock Lizard, Urchin Rat, Scissor Snake...

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:55.360
Three ingredients with a 
high degree of nutrients.

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:57.930
In this short time, your physical strength

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:00.530
should be restored to peak functioning.

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.370
You're going to eat the 
Poison Potato, aren't you?

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.200
You got me!

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:10.570
But I'm sorry, Toriko-san...

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:13.340
I was able to take out the 
parts with the stronger poison,

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:16.380
but there's still a lot of poison inside...

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:17.480
I don't mind!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:19.580
Like I said...

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.320
To me, there are no unlucky ingredients!

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:26.060
I never leave anything on my plate.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:27.960
Komatsu...

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:31.930
That goes double for any food you make.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.330
T-Toriko-san...

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:37.300
Okay!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:40.070
After I eat this, it'll be a total victory!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:44.910
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.480
Time to eat!

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:04.790
Delicious!!

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:07.760
I figured...

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:16.140
C-Coco-san!

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:19.870
Poison Potato is an ingredient 
that's compatible with Toriko.

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.680
But this is more than I imagined...

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:25.750
His evolved Gourmet Cells negated the poison.

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:29.780
Right from the start, I had 
a feelin' I could eat it!

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:33.850
Toriko-san, thank goodness!

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:34.990
Good grief...

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:36.560
Guy's somethin' else...

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:37.620
Toriko...

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:40.730
You're heading to even greater 
heights as a Gourmet Hunter...

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:42.700
You just keep climbing...

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:44.700
Still, Komatsu...

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:49.170
I could only enjoy eating 
poison thanks to your cooking.

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:51.340
Oh, I didn't do anything...

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:53.570
Livebearer!

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:56.240
Remember what you told me?

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:58.480
That you wouldn't mind 
partnering up with me...

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:04.080
Sorry, but I've already got 
the best partner right here.

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:08.290
Now then...

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:11.520
Let's get that Meteor Garlic.

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:12.290
Right!

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:16.400
What the hell is this?!

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:18.960
Creepy room...

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:22.830
Who would've guessed there'd be a place 
like this deep below the casino...

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:26.740
Is this your collection?

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:27.740
That's right.

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:33.750
All of the gourmet data I've 
collected is stored here.

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:36.580
Main ingredients are listed 
with the person's name...

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:41.020
There are even entire Full Courses 
of famous gourmets recorded here...

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.090
The whereabouts of Meteor Garlic...

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:46.560
So there's info here that'll 
give us a hint about it?

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:48.890
Acacia's drink...

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:50.330
Information on Atom...

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:54.170
Are you sure you don't need the 
memories that are in my brain?

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:58.340
You can enjoy the taste of 
Meteor Garlic from that data.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:01.240
Look, don't lump us together!

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:05.080
My friends and I aren't interested 
in devouring memories!

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.580
Food isn't in the noggin.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:09.480
It's somethin' you put in your mouth and eat!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:11.010
Is that right?

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:13.080
E-Even so...

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:17.850
...I'm a little bit interested 
in your memories, Livebearer-san.

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:22.560
If Coco of the Four Kings' 
Poison Knocking hadn't worked,

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:27.660
I'd be after your memories right about now!

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:30.430
Scary...

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:32.040
Alrighty!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.370
Meteor Garlic, Meteor Garlic...

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:38.140
This is...

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:40.110
Toriko!

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:42.210
I found it!

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:44.410
The ingredient you guys are looking for!

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:47.080
Meteor Garlic, the real thing...

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.050
What?!

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:50.720
The genuine Meteor Garlic?!

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:09.240
In those younger days,

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.140
No matter how you chased them,

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:15.710
The sky-spanning rainbows got away

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.010
After that, time passed

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:21.520
Were you able to grasp

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:26.150
The rainbow by the name of dreams then?

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:29.860
When it comes to a new challenge,

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:35.100
You turn into a coward,

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:40.570
But your chance ain't gonna wait on you,

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:45.440
So now's the time!

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:53.110
Bet those tears and that kindness

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:57.350
Will light up tomorrow

00:21:57.680 --> 00:22:00.420
That's right, rainbows are 
all the more beautiful

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:04.260
Because we can't catch 'em

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:08.060
Today's Gourmet Tasting Lecture!

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:09.660
I'm your newscaster, Tina.

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:12.200
We've arrived at last at the 
conclusion of Gourmet Tasting!

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:15.940
And the deciding factor 
of the showdown was...

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:17.900
Eating combination!

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:22.480
There are foods that go well 
together and those that don't.

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.380
A "good" example is natto and dried bonito.

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:31.020
The vitamin D in dried bonito absorbs 
the calcium in natto, which helps you!

00:22:34.220 --> 00:22:37.860
Coco calculated a bad combo for Livebearer.

00:22:37.860 --> 00:22:40.190
Meanwhile, Toriko had a good combo!

00:22:40.590 --> 00:22:43.430
Then, after Livebearer remarkably 
passed twice in a row,

00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:45.260
Toriko's team won!

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:48.430
And that brings us to today's cool point!

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:54.940
Coco's strategy was a heaping helping of 
wonderfulness, but Toriko was awesome!

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:57.410
The Poison Potato he ate at the 
end was compatible with him

00:22:57.410 --> 00:22:59.580
and even its poison was neutralized!

00:23:00.010 --> 00:23:01.980
Perfect victory!

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:04.720
V! V! Win!

00:23:07.180 --> 00:23:10.720
The legendary ingredient has finally appeared! How are they going to prepare it?

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:13.960
And the true ruler of the Jiddal Kingdom arrives!

00:23:14.310 --> 00:23:17.560
A Taste That's Out of This World! Eating the Meteor Garlic!

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:19.450
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
